# Ink cap 0: an ink cap tree 9.5 m tall, a long pale stem under a tall shaggy bell 3.4 m across whose rim has melted to black ink and
# drips (the part fungi_inkcap_bell), the gills' edges under it glowing cyan-green. The stem is the trunk of the collider.
format 1
collider capsule

Detail detail=0.2
    Union
        Material material=ftree_stem
            SmoothUnion smoothness=0.25
                Intersection
                    Ellipsoid radii=(0.7, 0.5, 0.7)
                    Translate translation=(0, 0.5, 0)
                        Box size=(2, 0.5, 2)
                ArbitraryRoundCone a=(0, 0.2, 0) b=(0.1, 6.5, 0) radiusA=0.38 radiusB=0.26
        Translate translation=(0.1, 6.0, 0)
            Part part=fungi_inkcap_bell
